e the order summary' => '订单摘要之前','Inside the order summary' => '订单摘要内页','Before the order totals' => '订单总数之前','After the order totals' => '订单总数之后','After the order summary' => '订单摘要之后','Shipping' => '运输','Select position where to display the shipping costs and calculator on the cart page.' => '选择在购物车页面显示运费和计算器的位置。','Display as a cart section' => '显示为购物车部分','Cross-sells' => '交叉销售','Select position where to display the cross-sells section on the cart page.' => '选择在购物车页面上显示交叉销售部分的位置。','Before the cart actions' => '购物车操作前','After the cart actions' => '购物车操作后','Layout of cross-sell items on the cart page.' => '购物车页面上交叉销售项目的布局。','Optimized horizontal cross-sells layout' => '优化横向交叉销售布局','Theme\'s cross-sells layout' => '主题的交叉销售布局','Number of cross-sell items to display on the cart page' => '购物车页面上要显示的交叉销售项目数量','Add widget areas to the cart page' => '在购物车页面添加小部件区域','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the cart page.' => '这些部件区域用于在购物车页面上添加信任符号和信任徽章。','Checkout' => '结账','Checkout layout' => '结账布局','Design template' => '设计模板','Dark mode' => '黑暗模式','Enable dark mode' => '启用黑暗模式','Logo image' => '徽标图像','Choose an image to be displayed on the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => '选择要显示在结账页面页眉上的图片。仅适用于使用无干扰页眉和页脚。','Header background color' => '标题背景颜色','Choose a background color for the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => '为结账页面页眉选择背景颜色。仅适用于使用无干扰页眉和页脚。','HTML color value. ie: #f3f3f3' => 'HTML 颜色值，即#f3f3f3','Page background color' => '页面背景颜色','Choose a background color for the checkout page. Color is applied to the <em>body</em> element.' => '为结账页面选择背景颜色。颜色应用于 <em>body</em> 元素。','Footer background color' => '页脚背景颜色','Choose a background color for the checkout page footer. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => '为结账页面页脚选择背景颜色。仅适用于使用无干扰页眉和页脚。','Progress bar' => '进度条','Display the checkout progress bar when using multi-step checkout layout' => '使用多步骤结账布局时显示结账进度条','Make the checkout progress bar stay visible while scrolling' => '使结账进度条在滚动时保持可见','Express checkout' => '快速结账','Enable the express checkout section' => '启用快速结账部分','Displays the express checkout section at checkout when supported payment gateways have this feature enabled.' => '如果支持的支付网关启用了快速结账功能，则在结账时显示快速结账部分。','Display express checkout buttons in one line for larger screens' => '在大屏幕上单行显示快递结账按钮','Ignore additional checkout required fields when paying with a compatible express checkout payment gateway' => '使用兼容的快速结账支付网关支付时，忽略额外的结账必填字段','Make the order summary stay visible while scrolling' => '使订单摘要在滚动时保持可见','Choose a background color for the order summary section.' => '为订单摘要部分选择背景颜色。','Highlight the order totals row in the order summary table' => '突出显示订单汇总表中的订单总数行','Most useful when the order summary section does not have a highlighted background color. Might also apply to the Cart, Order Received and View Order pages when using Fluid Checkout PRO.' => '在订单摘要部分没有高亮背景色时最有用。当使用流畅结账专业版时，也可能适用于购物车、已收到订单和查看订单页面。','Action link on the order summary at checkout.' => '结账时订单摘要上的行动链接。','Edit cart link' => '编辑购物车链接','Cart items count' => '购物车项目计数','Link to shop page' => '链接至商店页面','Cart items' => '购物车项目','Hide cart items errors at the checkout page' => '在结账页面隐藏购物车项目错误','Do not display the cart items errors message at the top of the checkout page. When submitting the checkout form to complete the purchase, these error messages will always be displayed.' => '不要在结账页面顶部显示购物车项目错误信息。在提交结账表单完成购买时，将始终显示这些错误信息。','Place order' => '下订单','Define the position to display "Place order" and terms checkbox section.' => '定义显示 "下订单 "和条款复选框部分的位置。','Some options might not be compatible with some plugins and themes.' => '某些选项可能与某些插件和主题不兼容。','Below the payment section' => '付款部分下方','Below the order summary' => '订单摘要下方','Both below the payment section and the order summary' => '付款部分和订单摘要下方均有','Add widget areas to the checkout page' => '在结账页面添加小部件区域','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the checkout page.' => '这些小部件区域用于在结账页面上添加信任符号和信任徽章。','Display the coupon codes section title' => '显示优惠券代码部分标题','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the checkout page.' => '选择在结账页面上显示优惠券代码部分的位置。','Before the checkout steps' => '结账步骤前','As a substep before payment methods' => '作为付款方式之前的一个子步骤','As a substep after payment methods' => '作为付款方式之后的一个子步骤','Default button style' => '默认按钮样式','"Add" link button' => '"添加 "链接按钮','Checkout fields' => '结账字段','Optional fields' => '可选字段','Hide optional fields behind a link button' => '在链接按钮后面隐藏可选字段','It is recommended to keep this option checked to reduce the number of open input fields, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => '建议选中此选项，以减少开放输入字段的数量，<a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">阅读研究</a>。','Do not hide "Address line 2" fields behind a link button' => '不要在链接按钮后面隐藏 "地址行 2 "字段','Recommended only when most customers actually need the "Address line 2" field, or when getting the right shipping address is crucial (ie. if delivering food and other perishable products).' => '只有当大多数客户确实需要 "地址行 2 "字段，或者获得正确的送货地址至关重要时（如运送食品和其他易腐产品），才建议使用。','Billing address' => '账单地址','Select position where to display the billing address section on the checkout page.' => '选择在结账页面上显示账单地址部分的位置。','As a step before shipping' => '作为运输前的一个步骤','As a sub-step before the shipping address section' => '作为送货地址部分之前的一个子步骤','As a sub-step after the shipping address section' => '作为送货地址部分之后的一个子步骤','As a step after shipping' => '作为运输后的一个步骤','As a sub-step before the payment section' => '作为付款部分之前的一个子步骤','Force billing and shipping addresses to the same (single section)' => '强制账单地址和送货地址相同（单一部分）','Checkbox for "Same as shipping/billing address" checked by default' => '默认选中 "与发货/账单地址相同 "复选框','The checkbox "Same as shiping address" will start as checked by default when the shipping address section is displayed first. <br>The checkbox "Same as billing address" will start as checked by default when the billing address section is displayed first. <br> It is recommended to leave this option checked as to significantly reduce the number of open input fields at checkout, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => '当先显示送货地址部分时，"与送货地址相同 "复选框将默认选中。<br>当先显示账单地址部分时，"与账单地址相同 "复选框将默认选中。<br> 建议选中此选项，以大幅减少结账时打开的输入字段数量，<a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">阅读研究</a>。','Highlight the billing address section in the checkout form' => '突出显示结账表单中的账单地址部分','Shipping address' => '送货地址','Highlight the shipping address section in the checkout form' => '突出显示结账表单中的送货地址部分','Shipping methods' => '运输方式','Choose in which position to display the shipping methods section.' => '选择在哪个位置显示运送方式部分。','Before shipping address' => '送货地址前','After shipping address' => '送货地址后','Local pickup' => '本地取件','Removes shipping address section when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => '选择本地取货送货方式时，删除送货地址部分。','Replaces the shipping address with the pickup point location when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => '选择本地取货发货方式时，用取货点位置替换发货地址。','Choose which address to save as the shipping address for local pickup orders.' => '选择哪个地址作为本地取货订单的送货地址。','Save the selected pickup location' => '保存选定的取件位置','Save same as the billing address' => '保存与账单地址相同','Do not save any shipping address' => '请勿保存任何送货地址','Company name field for shipping address' => '送货地址的公司名称字段','Change visibility for the company name field for the shipping address section on the checkout form.' => '更改结账表单送货地址部分公司名称字段的可见性。','If field is set as "optional", which is the default visibility state, no changes will be applied to let other plugins apply any changes they need.' => '如果字段设置为 "可选"（默认可见状态），则不会应用任何更改，以便其他插件应用它们需要的任何更改。','Hidden (remove field)' => '隐藏（删除字段）','Optional' => '可选','Required' => '需要','Add shipping phone field to the checkout form.' => '在结账表单中添加送货电话字段。','Choose in which step to display the shipping phone field.' => '选择在哪个步骤中显示发货电话字段。','Contact step' => '联系步骤','Billing phone' => '账单电话','Add billing phone field to the checkout form.' => '在结账表单中添加账单电话字段。','Choose in which step to display the billing phone field.' => '选择在哪个步骤中显示计费电话字段。','Show country code beside the flag' => '在国旗旁显示国家代码','Show an example of a valid phone number inside phone fields' => '在电话字段内显示有效电话号码的示例','Do not change placeholders' => '请勿更改占位符','Show if not defined' => '未定义时显示','Always show' => '始终显示','Order notes' => '订购说明','Define the visibility of the additional order notes field.' => '定义附加订单备注字段的可见性。','Gift options' => '礼品选择','Allow customers to add a gift message and other gift related options to the order.' => '允许客户在订单中添加礼品信息和其他礼品相关选项。','Display the gift message as part of the order details table instead of a separate section' => '将礼品信息作为订单详情表的一部分显示，而不是单独显示','This option affects the order confirmation page (thank you page) and order details on account pages, emails and packing slips.' => '该选项会影响订单确认页面（感谢页面）以及账户页面、电子邮件和装箱单上的订单详情。','Account matching' => '账户匹配','Enable the account matching feature' => '启用账户匹配功能','Associate the guest customer\'s orders with their existing account when an account already exists with the customer\'s contact details.' => '如果客户的联系信息已存在账户，则将客户的订单与其现有账户关联。','Display message when an account exists with the email address provided' => '当所提供的电子邮件地址存在账户时显示消息','Replaces the account creation fields with a notification and option to log in. In some contexts, it might be recommended to leave this option disabled to protect the privacy of customers.' => '用通知和登录选项取代账户创建字段。在某些情况下，建议禁用此选项，以保护客户隐私。','Dashboard' => '仪表板','Integrations' => '集成','License keys' => '许可证密钥','Visit our website for more information about our plugins and add-ons.' => '请访问我们的网站，了解有关插件和附加组件的更多信息。','Order pay page' => '订单支付页面','Order pay' => '订购付款','Enable order pay page optimizations' => '启用订单支付页面优化','Changes the layout of order pay page for existing orders pending payment from the customer.' => '更改待客户付款的现有订单的订单付款页面布局。','Add widget areas to the order pay page' => '在订单支付页面添加小部件区域','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the order pay page.' => '这些小部件区域用于在订单支付页面上添加信任符号和信任徽章。','Thank you page & order details layout' => '感谢页面和订单详情布局','Order details optimizations' => '订单详情优化','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations' => '优化感谢页面和订单详情','Changes the layout of order details on the thank you page and account pages.' => '更改感谢页面和账户页面上订单详细信息的布局。','Enable order details customizations on email notifications' => '在电子邮件通知中启用订单详情定制功能','Display new sections and change order of sections on email notifications. Styles of order details on email notifications remain unchanged.' => '在电子邮件通知中显示新部分并更改部分顺序。电子邮件通知上的订单详情样式保持不变。','Thank you page' => '感谢页面','These options affect the thank you page, also known as order received or order confirmation pages.' => '这些选项会影响 "感谢 "页面，也称为 "已收到订单 "或 "订单确认 "页面。','Order details layout' => '订单详细信息布局','Display the order details with wide layout on the thank you page' => '在 "感谢 "页面以宽布局显示订单详情','Add widget areas to the thank you page' => '在感谢页面添加小部件区域','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the thank you page.' => '这些小部件区域用于在感谢页面上添加信任符号和信任徽章。','Order actions' => '命令行动','Choose in which position to display the order actions.' => '选择在哪个位置显示订单操作。','Inside the order overview' => '订单概览','After the order overview' => '订单概览之后','After order sections' => '订购后部分','Order status' => '订单状态','Display the order status progress bar' => '显示订单状态进度条','Choose in which position to display the section.' => '选择在哪个位置显示该部分。','After the order overview and payment instructions' => '订单概述和付款说明之后','Before the order items section' => '在订单项目部分之前','Inside the order items section' => '在订单项目部分','After the order items section' => '在订单项目部分之后','On the sidebar' => '侧边栏','Order downloads' => '订购下载','Gift message' => '礼品信息','Tools' => '工具','Troubleshooting' => '故障排除','Debug options' => '调试选项','Debug mode' => '调试模式','Using debug mode affects the website performance. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => '使用调试模式会影响网站性能。仅在排除故障时使用该选项。','Load unminified assets' => '加载未销毁的资产','Enhanced select fields' => '增强的选择字段','Fix automatic zoom-in on form fields' => '修复表单字段的自动放大','Set <code>font-size</code> inside form fields to 16px' => '将表单字段内的 <code> 字体大小</code> 设置为 16px','Fluid Checkout' => '流体检查','Settings' => '设置','Support' => '支持','<a target="_blank" href="%s">Upgrade to PRO</a> to unlock more options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%s">升级到专业版</a>可解锁更多选项。','(PRO)' => '（专业人员）','(experimental)' => '（实验）','Please verify your phone number.' => '请核实您的电话号码。','The Bluehost Plugin' => 'Bluehost 插件','Custom fields' => '自定义字段','Enable custom shipping email field' => '启用自定义发货电子邮件字段','When enabled, the shipping email field from the Bluehost plugin will be added to the checkout form.' => '启用后，Bluehost 插件中的发货电子邮件字段将添加到结账表单中。','Captcha Pro by BestWebSoft' => 'Captcha Pro by BestWebSoft','Captcha position' => '验证码位置','Define the position to display the captcha section. Some positions might not work depending on the captcha type chosen.' => '定义显示验证码部分的位置。根据所选的验证码类型，某些位置可能不起作用。','Selecting a pickup point is required before proceeding.' => '在继续之前，需要选择一个取件点。','Pickup point' => '上车点','Pickup point not selected yet.' => '尚未选择拾取点。','Pickup point:' => '上车地点','Mailchimp for WooCommerce' => '适用于 WooCommerce 的 Mailchimp','Subscribe checkbox' => '订阅复选框','Override the position for the subscribe checkbox on the checkout page and always display it on the contact step' => '覆盖结账页面上订阅复选框的位置，并始终将其显示在联系步骤中','Before Shipping Address' => '送货地址','(originally "%s")' => '(原为"%s"）','After Shipping Address' => '寄件地址后','Selecting a collection point is required when shipping with FermoPoint.' => '使用 FermoPoint 发货时需要选择一个收集点。','If checked informs typos in email to users. (This feature has been disabled because Fluid Checkout offers the feature. Changes to this option will not take effect)' => '如果选中，则会在发送给用户的电子邮件中告知错字。(该功能已被禁用，因为 Fluid Checkout 提供了该功能。对该选项的更改不会生效）','Enable Mail Check: (disabled feature)' => '启用邮件检查：（禁用功能）','Carrier:' => '运营商：','Sendinblue - WooCommerce Email Marketing' => 'Sendinblue - WooCommerce 电子邮件营销','Sign up checkbox position' => '注册复选框位置','Move the sign up checkbox to the contact step' => '将注册复选框移至联系人步骤','When enabled, the checkbox will be moved to the contact step independently of the display location defined in the Sendinblue plugin settings.' => '启用后，复选框将被移动到联系人步骤，与 Sendinblue 插件设置中定义的显示位置无关。','Theme Betheme' => '主题 Betheme','Checkout progress' => '结账进度','Output the checkout steps section from Betheme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => '在结账、购物车和收到订单页面上输出 Betheme 的结账步骤部分。','Theme Fennik' => '芬尼克主题','Breadcrumbs' => '面包屑','Output the breadcrumbs section from the Fennik theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => '使用流体结账页眉和页脚时，输出 Fennik 主题中的面包屑部分。','Theme Go' => '主题围棋','My account layout' => '我的账户布局','Enable wide layout on "My account" page.' => '在 "我的账户 "页面启用宽布局。','Theme Impreza' => '主题翼豹','Header' => '页眉','Spacing for site header at the checkout page (in pixels)' => '结账页面的网站页眉间距（单位：像素）','Only applicable when using the Impreza theme header at the checkout page.' => '仅适用于在结账页面使用 Impreza 主题标题时。','Theme Kapee' => '主题 Kapee','Output the checkout steps section from the Kapee theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => '在结账、购物车和收到订单页面上输出 Kapee 主题中的结账步骤部分。','Theme Porto' => '主题波尔图','Output the checkout steps section from the Porto theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => '在结账、购物车和收到订单页面上输出 Porto 主题中的结账步骤部分。','Theme Pressmart' => '主题印刷机','Output the checkout steps section from the Pressmart theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => '在结账、购物车和收到订单页面上输出 Pressmart 主题中的结账步骤部分。','Theme The Gem' => '宝石主题','Output the checkout steps section from The Gem theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => '使用流体结账页眉和页脚时，输出 The Gem 主题中的结账步骤部分。','Theme Woodmart' => '主题 Woodmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Woodmart theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => '使用流体结账页眉和页脚时，输出 Woodmart 主题中的结账步骤部分。','Checkout options' => '结账选项','Disable the theme checkout options' => '禁用主题结账选项','The options display product image, quantity field, remove button and link to product page added by the theme are disabled by default.' => '默认情况下，主题添加的显示产品图片、数量字段、移除按钮和产品页面链接选项是禁用的。','Theme Atomion' => '主题 Atomion','Order progress' => '订单进度','Display order progress from the theme' => '从主题中显示订单进度','Display the form field labels visible on the page' => '显示页面上可见的表单字段标签','It is recommended to keep this option enabled for a better user experience.' => '建议启用该选项，以获得更好的用户体验。','Theme ZK Nito' => '主题 ZK Nito','Add extra fields to the checkout form' => '在结账表单中添加额外字段','Adds an extra shipping email and shipping phone field to the shipping address section.' => '在送货地址部分添加额外的送货电子邮件和送货电话字段。','Go to the home page' => '转到主页','Skip to content' => '跳至内容','Create an account' => '创建账户','Log in to your account' => '登录您的账户','Already have an account?' => '已有账户？','Logged in as %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Log out</a>' => '以 %1$s 登录。<a href="%2$s">退出</a>。','Your order has a total amount due of %s. No further payment is needed.' => '您的订单总金额为 %s。无需再付款。','Close and continue with checkout' => '关闭并继续结账','Continue' => '继续','Parcel terminal' => '包裹终端','<p>This widget has been replaced by Fluid Checkout. </p><p>When using Fluid Checkout, the checkout page needs to use the original WooCommerce shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> to work properly.</p><p>For more information, visit the Fluid Checkout documentation.</p>' => '<p>此部件已被 Fluid Checkout 取代。</p><p>使用 Fluid Checkout 时，结账页面需要使用原始 WooCommerce shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> 才能正常工作。</p><p>有关详细信息，请访问 Fluid Checkout 文档。','Theme The7' => '主题7','Additional header sections' => '附加页眉部分','Output additional header sections if enabled in the theme settings.' => '如果在主题设置中启用，则输出额外的标题部分。','More information' => '更多信息','Pick a Locker' => '挑选储物柜','Page template' => '页面模板','Use `Order confirmation` page template for block-based themes' => '为基于区块的主题使用 "订单确认 "页面模板','Only applies when using a block-based theme.' => '仅适用于使用基于区块的主题。','WooCommerce Stripe Gateway' => 'WooCommerce Stripe 网关','Payment form' => '付款表格','Apply styles to the Stripe payment form fields' => '为 Stripe 支付表单字段应用样式','When enabled, Fluid Checkout will apply styles optimized for compatibility with the plugin. You may want to disable this if you are using custom styles for the Stripe payment form fields.' => '启用后，Fluid Checkout 将应用为与插件兼容而优化的样式。如果您对 Stripe 支付表单字段使用自定义样式，则可能需要禁用此功能。','Theme Nyture' => '主题 Nyture','Output the checkout steps section from the Nyture theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 时，输出 Nyture 主题中的结账步骤部分。','Allows customers to make payments for orders that are either created manually by the store admin or not completed during checkout.' => '允许客户为商店管理员手动创建或结账时未完成的订单付款。','The plugin WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers is not compatible with Fluid Checkout' => 'Quadlayers 的 WooCommerce Checkout Manager 插件与 Fluid Checkout 不兼容。','Company name field for billing address' => '账单地址的公司名称字段','Change visibility for the company name field for the billing address section on the checkout form.' => '更改结账表单账单地址部分公司名称字段的可见性。','Theme Bookshelf' => '主题书架','Output the checkout steps section from the Bookshelf theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => '使用 Fluid Checkout 时，输出 Bookshelf 主题中的结账步骤部分。','Account password' => '账户密码','An account will be created with the information provided at checkout when completing the order.' => '在完成订单时，将使用结账时提供的信息创建一个账户。','Choose the style of the progress bar.' => '选择进度条的样式。','Bars' => '酒吧','Theme Ireca' => '主题 Ireca','WooCommerce page layout' => 'WooCommerce 页面布局','Force wide layout on WooCommerce pages' => '在 WooCommerce 页面上强制使用宽布局','This ensures the content section is not too narrow on WooCommerce pages including checkout, cart, order received, order pay and account pages.' => '这可确保 WooCommerce 页面（包括结账、购物车、收到订单、订单支付和账户页面）上的内容部分不会过于狭窄。','WooCommerce Smart Coupons' => 'WooCommerce 智能优惠券','Position on checkout page' => '在结账页面上的位置','Choose where to display the available coupons section on the checkout page.' => '选择在结账页面上显示可用优惠券部分的位置。','Before the progress bar' => '进度条之前','After the progress bar' => '进度条之后','Before coupon codes section' => '优惠券代码部分之前','Format phone numbers according to the rules for each country.' => '根据各国的规定格式化电话号码。','Use precise phone number validation' => '使用精确的电话号码验证','This is an experimental feature and may not work as expected in all setups. Use it with caution.' => '这是一项试验性功能，可能无法在所有设置中正常工作。请谨慎使用。','Phone number validation types used when precise validation is enabled.' => '启用精确验证时使用的电话号码验证类型。','Mobile' => '移动电话','Fixed line' => '固定线路','Toll free' => '免费电话','Contact' => '联系方式','Multi step' => '多步骤','2 columns' => '2 列','1 column' => '1 列','Before checkout steps' => '结账前步骤','Or' => '或者','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> checkout layout this option is always set to <em>"Before checkout steps"</em> and also applies to desktop view.' => '使用<em>"1 列"</em>结账布局时，此选项始终设置为<em>"结账步骤前"</em>，也适用于桌面视图。','Position for the extra order summary section on mobile.' => '为移动设备上的额外订单摘要部分定位。','The option <em>"On the site header"</em> only applies when using the distraction-free header.' => '选项 <em>"在网站页眉上"</em> 仅适用于使用无干扰页眉时。','On the site header (requires distraction-free header)' => '在网站页眉上（要求页眉不分散注意力）','Initial state for the expansible order summary section on mobile.' => '移动设备上可扩展订单摘要部分的初始状态。','We recommend setting it as <em>expanded</em> for the following countries due to regulatory requirements: <strong>Germany</strong>, <strong>Austria</strong>, <strong>Switzerland</strong>, <strong>Netherlands</strong>, <strong>Poland</strong>, <strong>Belgium</strong> and <strong>France</strong>.' => '由于监管要求，我们建议以下国家/地区将其设置为<em>扩展</em>：<strong>德国</strong>、<strong>奥地利</strong>、<strong>瑞士</strong>、<strong>荷兰</strong>、<strong>波兰</strong>、<strong>比利时</strong>和<strong>法国</strong>。','Collapsed' => '倒塌','Expanded' => '已扩展','Do not show' => '不显示','yes' => '是','The shipping phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the billing phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => '如果“收货地址”部分之后显示“账单地址”部分，且“账单电话”字段被设为“必填”，则“收货电话”字段可能会被强制设为“必填”。这样做是为了确保在勾选该选项时，收货地址能够被复制到账单地址中，否则客户可能无法完成结账流程。','The billing phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the shipping phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => '如果“账单地址”部分显示在“送货地址”部分之前，且“送货电话”字段被设为“必填”，则“账单电话”字段可能会被强制设为“必填”。这样做是为了确保在勾选该选项时，送货地址能够被复制到账单地址中，否则客户可能无法完成结账流程。','Settings profiles' => '设置配置文件','Settings profile' => '设置配置文件','You do not have permission to perform this action.' => '您无权执行此操作。','You do not have permission to activate plugins.' => '您没有权限激活插件。','Missing plugin.' => '缺少插件。','Plugin activated.' => '插件已激活。','The following changes will be applied:' => '将应用以下更改：','Since Fluid Checkout 5.0, settings are saved differently. Legacy options are still stored in the database to allow downgrades to previous versions if needed.' => '从 Fluid Checkout 5.0 开始，设置的保存方式发生了变化。旧版选项仍保存在数据库中，以便在需要时降级到以前的版本。','Your store has been running for about 2 weeks on the new settings so you could clean up legacy options stored in the database. Please note that after cleanup, if you need to downgrade to previous versions of the plugin it will use default values for all settings.' => '您的商店已按照新设置运行了大约两周，因此您可以清理数据库中存储的旧版选项。请注意，清理完成后，如果您需要降级到该插件的旧版本，所有设置都将使用默认值。','Fluid Checkout settings cleanup' => '清理“流体结账”设置','Delete leftover options' => '删除剩余选项','Help us improve Fluid Checkout' => '请帮助我们改进“Fluid Checkout”','Share anonymous site environment reports with Fluid Checkout to get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. No customer, user, or sensitive data are included. You can choose what is shared anytime from the Tools settings.' => '通过 Fluid Checkout 分享匿名的网站环境报告，以便更快获得支持，并帮助我们改进兼容性及评估影响。报告中不包含任何客户、用户或敏感数据。您可以随时在“工具”设置中选择要分享的内容。','Enable site environment reports' => '启用站点环境报告','Review settings' => '查看设置','This preview has expired. Reload the admin page to start a new preview.' => '此预览已过期。请刷新管理页面以开始新的预览。','Preview expired' => '预览已过期','Orders cannot be placed in the preview.' => '在预览模式下无法下单。','Logging in is not available in the preview.' => '预览版中不支持登录。','Accounts cannot be created in the preview.' => '在预览模式下无法创建账户。','Requests to other sites are blocked in the preview.' => '在预览中，对其他网站的请求会被拦截。','Processing…' => '正在处理……','Something went wrong. Please try again.' => '出现错误。请重试。','Activate plugin' => '激活插件','Fluid Checkout PRO - The complete checkout package' => 'Fluid Checkout PRO——完整的结账解决方案','All PRO features + all add-ons, one price. Design templates, optimized cart and order received pages, account matching, and much more.' => '所有 PRO 功能 + 所有附加组件，一价全包。设计模板、经过优化的购物车和订单确认页面、账户匹配功能，以及更多功能。','Optimized order pay page' => '优化后的订单支付页面','Express checkout buttons from supported payment methods' => '支持的支付方式中的快速结账按钮','Delayed account creation' => '账户创建延迟','Address autocomplete with Google Maps APIs' => '使用 Google 地图 API 实现地址自动完成','Multiple saved addresses with the address book' => '在通讯录中保存多个地址','EU-VAT assistant' => '欧盟增值税助手','Hide this section' => '隐藏此部分','Learn more' => '了解更多','Get early access' => '抢先体验','Activate add-on' => '激活插件','Get more out of your checkout journey' => '让您的结账体验更上一层楼','Test API key' => '测试 API 密钥','Guided setup' => '向导式设置','Options' => '选项','Set up layout and design on the <a href="%s">checkout options</a>.' => '在 <a href="%s"> 结账选项 </a> 中设置版式和设计。','Enable guest checkout and/or review <a href="%s">customer accounts settings</a>.' => '启用访客结账功能和/或查看 <a href="%s">客户账户设置</a>。','Enable optimized <a href="%1$s">cart</a>, <a href="%2$s">thank you</a> and <a href="%3$s">order pay</a> pages.' => '启用优化的 <a href="%1$s">购物车</a>、<a href="%2$s">感谢页</a> 和 <a href="%3$s">订单支付</a> 页面。','Enable <a href="%s">address autocomplete</a> from Google Maps.' => '启用 Google 地图的 <a href="%s">地址自动补全</a> 功能。','Enable multiple saved addresses with <a href="%s">address book</a>.' => '通过 <a href="%s">通讯录</a> 启用多个已保存地址。','Check if there are any <a href="%s">integration options</a> available for the theme or other plugins you have installed.' => '请检查您已安装的主题或其他插件是否提供任何 <a href="%s">集成选项</a>。','Get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. <a href="%s">Enable usage tracking</a> from the tools settings.' => '更快地获得支持，并帮助我们改进兼容性及评估影响。<a href="%s">在工具设置中启用使用情况跟踪</a>。','Missing settings tab.' => '缺少“设置”选项卡。','Getting started' => '入门指南','<strong>Great! Your checkout page is now running on Fluid Checkout.</strong> Here are a few steps to get started:' => '<strong>太好了！您的结账页面现已迁移至 Fluid Checkout。</strong> 以下是开始使用的几个步骤：','Completed' => '已完成','Preview report data' => '预览报告数据','Send now' => '立即发送','Auto-detect' => '自动检测','Afrikaans' => '南非语','Albanian' => '阿尔巴尼亚语','Amharic' => '阿姆哈拉语','Arabic' => '阿拉伯语','Armenian' => '亚美尼亚语','Azerbaijani' => '阿塞拜疆语','Basque' => '巴斯克语','Belarusian' => '白俄罗斯语','Bengali' => '孟加拉语','Bosnian' => '波斯尼亚语','Bulgarian' => '保加利亚语','Burmese' => '缅甸语','Catalan' => '加泰罗尼亚语','Chinese' => '中文','Chinese (Simplified)' => '中文（简体）','Chinese (Hong Kong)' => '中文（香港）','Chinese (Traditional)' => '中文（繁體）','Croatian' => '克罗地亚语','Czech' => '捷克语','Danish' => '丹麦语','Dutch' => '荷兰语','English' => '英语','English (Australian)' => '英语（澳大利亚）','English (Great Britain)' => '英语（英国）','Estonian' => '爱沙尼亚语','Farsi' => '波斯语','Finnish' => '芬兰语','Filipino' => '菲律宾人','French' => '法语','French (Canadian)' => '法语（加拿大）','Galician' => '加利西亚语','Georgian' => '格鲁吉亚语','German' => '德语','Greek' => '希腊语','Gujarati' => '古吉拉特语','Hebrew' => '希伯来语','Hindi' => '印地语','Hungarian' => '匈牙利语','Icelandic' => '冰岛语','Indonesian' => '印尼语','Italian' => '意大利语','Japanese' => '日语','Kannada' => '卡纳达语','Kazakh' => '哈萨克语','Khmer' => '高棉语','Korean' => '韩语','Kyrgyz' => '吉尔吉斯','Lao' => '老挝','Latvian' => '拉脱维亚语','Lithuanian' => '立陶宛语','Macedonian' => '马其顿语','Malay' => '马来语','Malayalam' => '马拉雅拉姆语','Marathi' => '马拉地语','Mongolian' => '蒙古语','Nepali' => '尼泊尔语','Norwegian' => '挪威语','Polish' => '波兰语','Portuguese' => '葡萄牙语','Portuguese (Brazil)' => '葡萄牙语（巴西）','Portuguese (Portugal)' => '葡萄牙语（葡萄牙）','Punjabi' => '旁遮普语','Romanian' => '罗马尼亚语','Russian' => '俄语','Serbian' => '塞尔维亚语','Sinhalese' => '僧伽罗语','Slovak' => '斯洛伐克语','Slovenian' => '斯洛文尼亚语','Spanish' => '西班牙语','Spanish (Latin America)' => '西班牙语（拉丁美洲）','Swahili' => '斯瓦希里语','Swedish' => '瑞典语','Tamil' => '泰米尔语','Telugu' => '泰卢固语','Thai' => '泰语','Turkish' => '土耳其语','Ukrainian' => '乌克兰语','Urdu' => '乌尔都语','Vietnamese' => '越南语','Zulu' => '祖鲁语','Google address autocomplete' => '谷歌地址自动补全','Google Places API version' => 'Google Places API 版本','Choose which version of the Google Places API to use. We recommend moving to the new Places API as soon as possible.' => '请选择要使用的 Google Places API 版本。我们建议您尽快迁移到新的 Places API。','We recommend using "Places API (New)" as effective March 1, 2025, Google will move the "Places API (Legacy)" version into Legacy status, meaning you will no longer be able to enable this service for new API keys and that that version of the API will eventually not be available anymore. Existing accounts already using the Legacy API may continue to work without disruptions.' => '我们建议您使用“Places API（新版）”，因为自 2025 年 3 月 1 日起，Google 将把“Places API（旧版）”设为“弃用”状态，这意味着您将无法再为新的 API 密钥启用此服务，且该版本的 API 最终将不再可用。 已使用旧版 API 的现有账户可继续正常运行，不会受到影响。','(Recommended)' => '(推荐)','Google API key' => 'Google API 密钥','Paste your Google API key and use the test button to confirm it works for this website. Make sure the key is valid and allowed for your domain, otherwise the address field might get blocked preventing customers from completing their orders.' => '粘贴您的 Google API 密钥，并点击“测试”按钮确认其在本网站上能否正常工作。请确保该密钥有效且已授权用于您的域名，否则地址字段可能会被屏蔽，导致客户无法完成订单。','Enable Google address autocomplete' => '启用 Google 地址自动完成功能','Enable address autocompletion using the Google Maps APIs.' => '使用 Google 地图 API 启用地址自动补全功能。','Google API language' => 'Google API 语言','This language will be used to display the Google Places API address suggestions and addresses will also be autocompleted in this language.' => '将使用此语言显示 Google Places API 的地址建议，地址也会以此语言进行自动补全。','Result types' => '结果类型','Leave empty to accept any type of results, which usually yields better matching results. <a href="%s" target="_blank">See documentation for more details</a>. <br>Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on address autocomplete fields. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => '留空表示接受任何类型的搜索结果，这通常能获得更匹配的结果。<a href="%s" target="_blank">请参阅文档以获取更多详细信息</a>。<br>最多可选择 5 种地址搜索结果类型，这些结果将在地址自动完成字段中显示。 <br>请访问 Google 地图文档，了解有关 <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">支持的类型</a> 的更多信息。','Result types (Legacy API)' => '结果类型（旧版 API）','Which type of address search results to return when using Places API (Legacy). <br>Visit the documentation of the Legacy Google Places API to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => '使用 Places API（旧版）时应返回哪种类型的地址搜索结果。 <br>请访问旧版 Google Places API 的文档，了解有关 <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">支持的类型</a>的更多信息。','Company fields' => '公司字段','Enable autocomplete for the company name if available' => '如果可用，请启用公司名称的自动完成功能','Enable autocompletion of the company field with the company name information when returned from the Google Maps APIs.' => '启用公司字段的自动完成功能，当从 Google 地图 API 返回公司名称信息时，该功能将自动补全。','Business search' => '企业搜索','Enable search for businesses in the company field' => '启用在“公司”字段中搜索企业','Enable suggestion of addresses associated with a business when typing in the company field, then autocomplete all addresses fields when a business is selected from the suggestions.' => '在输入“公司”字段时，启用与该企业关联的地址建议功能；当从建议中选定一家企业后，自动填充所有地址字段。','Company result types' => '公司业绩类型','Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on autocomplete company fields. <br>Recommended value is <code>establishment</code>, which includes most types of businesses. <br>Leave empty to accept any type of results, including results that are not related to businesses. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => '最多可选择 5 种地址搜索结果类型，用于在公司字段的自动完成功能中显示。<br>推荐值是 <code>机构</code>，该选项涵盖了大多数企业类型。<br>若留空，则接受任何类型的搜索结果，包括与企业无关的结果。 <br>请访问 Google 地图文档，了解有关 <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">支持的类型</a>的更多信息。','Google logo' => '谷歌标志','Show text and logo "Powered by Google"' => '显示“由 Google 提供支持”的文字和徽标','When checked, the text and logo "Powered by Google" will be displayed at the bottom of the address autocomplete suggestions box.' => '勾选此选项后，地址自动完成建议框的底部将显示“由 Google 提供支持”的文字和徽标。','Brasil API address autocomplete' => '巴西 API 地址自动补全','Brasil API' => '巴西 API','Enable Brasil API address autocomplete for CEP fields' => '为 CEP 字段启用巴西 API 地址自动补全功能','Use Brasil API to retrieve and autofill addresses using the CEP/Postcode field. Only relevant for Brazilian addresses.' => '使用巴西 API 通过 CEP/邮政编码字段检索并自动填写地址。仅适用于巴西地址。','API version' => 'API 版本','Choose which version of the Brasil API CEP method to use.' => '选择要使用的 Brasil API CEP 方法的哪个版本。','Address book migration' => '通讯录迁移','WooCommerce addresses' => 'WooCommerce 地址','Copy existing shipping and billing addresses from WooCommerce into the customers\' address book.' => '将 WooCommerce 中的现有发货地址和账单地址复制到客户的地址簿中。','Enable the address book feature' => '启用通讯录功能','Allow customers to save multiple addresses and define the default address to be used for shipping and billing.' => '允许客户保存多个地址，并设置用于发货和开票的默认地址。','Address labels' => '地址标签','Allow customers to add a custom label for each address' => '允许客户为每个地址添加自定义标签','Address labels make it easier to for customers to distinguish between their saved addresses (ie.: "Mom\'s House"). The address labels are private to the customers, and will not be displayed or printed on the order details page or invoices.' => '地址标签可帮助客户更轻松地区分其保存的地址（例如：“妈妈家”）。这些地址标签仅供客户本人查看，不会在订单详情页或发票上显示或打印。','Display layout' => '显示布局','Choose how saved addresses are displayed at checkout and on the cart.' => '选择在结账和购物车页面中如何显示已保存的地址。','Applies at checkout and on the cart. Saved addresses on the account page always use the cards layout.' => '在结账时和购物车中均可使用。账户页面中保存的地址始终采用卡片式布局。','Address cards' => '地址卡','Address list' => '地址列表','Dropdown field' => '下拉菜单字段','Address search' => '地址搜索','Show address search filter on frontend when customer has at least this number of saved addresses available.' => '当客户至少拥有此数量的已保存地址时，在前端显示地址搜索筛选器。','Not used when display layout is set to dropdown field.' => '当显示布局设置为下拉字段时，不使用此选项。','Addresses' => '地址','Enable cart page optimizations to see more options' => '启用购物车页面优化功能，查看更多选项','Sticky order summary' => '置顶订单摘要','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the cart page. Only applicable when AJAX cart is enabled, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => '选择在购物车页面上显示优惠码区域的位置。仅当启用了 AJAX 购物车，且在 WooCommerce 设置中启用了优惠码功能时才适用。','Layout of cross-sell' => '交叉销售的布局','Cross-sells displayed' => '显示了交叉销售商品','Items' => '项目','Cart page optimization' => '购物车页面优化','Give your cart the same clear, conversion-focused layout as your checkout.' => '让您的购物车采用与结账页面同样清晰、以转化率为核心的布局。','Match the cart layout to the checkout page for a consistent purchase journey.' => '将购物车布局与结算页面保持一致，以确保购买流程的一致性。','Keep the cart always updated in the background, no full page reloads when quantities change.' => '在后台保持购物车始终处于最新状态，数量发生变化时无需刷新整个页面。','Place coupon codes, shipping, and cross-sells exactly where they convert best.' => '将优惠码、运费信息和交叉销售内容精准放置在转化率最高的位置。','Keep the order summary visible while scrolling, and add trust symbols where shoppers need reassurance.' => '在滚动页面时保持订单摘要可见，并在需要让购物者感到安心的地方添加信任标识。','Columns' => '专栏','General styles for the checkout steps, order summary and other sections. Applies to other checkout, cart, thank you (order received), and view order pages.' => '结账步骤、订单摘要及其他部分的通用样式。适用于其他结账、购物车、感谢（订单已收到）和查看订单页面。','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> layout with the <em>"Split"</em> design template, a right column is shown only if the page sidebar widget area is active (Checkout Sidebar, Cart Sidebar, or Order Received Sidebar). Otherwise the page stays as a single column with Split styles.' => '当使用 <em>“1 列”</em> 布局配合 <em>“分栏”</em> 设计模板时，只有在页面侧边栏小工具区域处于活动状态（结账侧边栏、购物车侧边栏或订单确认侧边栏）时，才会显示右侧栏。否则，页面将保持为采用“分栏”样式的单列布局。','Split column background' => '分割列背景','Choose a background color for the Split design secondary column. Leave empty to use the order summary background color.' => '为“分栏”设计的次要栏选择一种背景色。若留空，则使用订单摘要的背景色。','Page templates' => '页面模板','Checkout template' => '结账模板','Recommended for fewer distractions at checkout. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Read the research about cart abandonment</a>.' => '建议采用此方案以减少结账时的干扰。<a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">阅读关于购物车放弃率的研究</a>。','Sticky progress bar' => '固定式进度条','Progress bar style' => '进度条样式','Order totals' => '订单总额','Background color' => '背景色','Action link' => '操作链接','Mobile order summary' => '移动端订单摘要','Mobile initial state' => '移动端初始状态','Enable editing cart items at checkout' => '在结账时允许编辑购物车中的商品','Allow customers to change product quantities or remove items directly at the checkout page.' => '允许客户在结账页面直接更改商品数量或移除商品。','Cart item errors' => '购物车项目错误','Only applicable when coupon code is displayed as a separate section on the checkout or cart pages, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => '仅当优惠码在结账或购物车页面上作为独立板块显示，且在 WooCommerce 设置中已启用优惠码功能时才适用。','Coupon codes position' => '优惠码位置','Apply coupon button' => '“使用优惠券”按钮','Select style of the "apply coupon" button.' => '选择“使用优惠券”按钮的样式。','Address line 2' => '地址第2行','This setting is shared between the Checkout and Local pickup sections. On the Local pickup section, it also decides whether the Ship/Pickup selector shows inside the shipping method section (before the address) or as a separate section (after).' => '此设置在“结账”和“自提”部分之间共享。在“自提”部分，它还决定了“配送/自提”选择器是显示在配送方式部分内（地址之前），还是作为独立部分显示（地址之后）。','Customer accounts' => '客户账户','Guest checkout' => '访客结账','Guest checkout, login, and account creation options from the WooCommerce Accounts settings page. They are managed here for your convenience, and so you can use different values per settings profile.' => 'WooCommerce“账户”设置页面中的“访客结账”、“登录”和“创建账户”选项。为方便您管理，这些选项在此处统一设置，您还可以根据不同的设置配置文件使用不同的值。','Allow customers to checkout without an account' => '允许客户无需注册账户即可结账','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to create an account or log in during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>建议</strong>，这样客户在结账时就无需创建账户或登录，从而可以降低转化率。','When disabled, customers must log in or create an account to complete the purchase.' => '如果此功能已禁用，客户必须登录或注册账户才能完成购买。','Login at checkout' => '结账时登录','Enable log-in during checkout' => '在结账时启用登录功能','Show a link for returning customers to log in from the checkout page.' => '在结账页面上显示一个链接，供老客户登录。','Account creation' => '创建账户','Allow customers to create an account during checkout' => '允许客户在结账时创建账户','Customers can create an account before placing their order.' => '客户可以在下单前注册一个账户。','Allow customers to create an account from the My account page' => '允许客户在“我的账户”页面创建账户','Customers can register a new account from the My account page.' => '客户可以在“我的账户”页面注册新账户。','Username' => '用户名','Generate from customer\'s name' => '根据客户姓名生成','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to choose a username during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>建议</strong>，这样客户在结账时就无需选择用户名，从而可以降低转化率。','A username is generated from the customer name, or from the email address when a name cannot be used.' => '用户名由客户姓名生成；若无法使用姓名，则由电子邮箱地址生成。','Password' => '密码','Send password setup link' => '发送密码设置链接','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to set a password during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>建议</strong>，这样客户在结账时就无需设置密码，从而可以降低转化率。','Customers receive an email to create their password securely.' => '客户会收到一封电子邮件，用于安全地设置密码。','Let registered customers complete checkout without logging in and associate the order with their existing account when contact details match.' => '允许已注册客户无需登录即可完成结账，并在联系信息匹配时将订单与他们的现有账户关联。','Existing account message' => '现有账户通知','Let customers create an account after placing their order, from the thank you page.' => '允许客户在下单后，通过“感谢页面”创建账户。','Options in this section are available when guest checkout and account matching are enabled. Enable both features above to configure delayed account creation.' => '只有在启用了“访客结账”和“账户匹配”功能时，本节中的选项才可用。请启用上述两项功能，以配置延迟创建账户。','Enable delayed account creation' => '启用延迟创建账户功能','Enable delayed account creation when both guest checkout and account matching are enabled.' => '当“访客结账”和“账户匹配”均已启用时，启用延迟账户创建功能。','Section position' => '分部职位','Before customer details section' => '“客户详细信息”部分之前','After customer details section' => '“客户详细信息”部分之后','Account creation benefits' => '注册账户的福利','Leaving the field empty will display the default text.' => '如果该字段留空，将显示默认文本。','Inline buttons' => '行内按钮','Required fields' => '必填字段','Enable gift message fields at checkout' => '在结账时启用礼品留言栏','Expanded gift message' => '扩展的赠言','Display gift message field always expanded' => '“显示礼品留言”字段始终展开','Gift message in order details' => '订单详情中的赠言','No integrations available at the moment on this section. The options related to each plugin and theme will only appear here when that plugin or theme is activated.' => '目前该部分暂无可用集成。只有在激活了相关插件或主题后，与该插件或主题相关的选项才会显示在此处。','Phone fields' => '电话字段','Field visibility' => '字段可见性','Field position' => '场上位置','Phone country code & validation' => '电话国家代码与验证','Country' => '国家','Enable country on phone fields' => '在手机字段中启用国家/地区选项','Filter countries for shipping or billing' => '按配送或账单国家/地区筛选','Limit the country selector on each phone field to the countries allowed for shipping or billing on your store.' => '将每个电话输入框中的国家/地区选择器限制为您的商店中允许用于发货或账单结算的国家/地区。','Validation' => '验证','Enable simple validation based on country rules' => '启用基于国家规则的简单验证','Checks that the phone number is valid for the selected country, including country code and length.' => '检查该电话号码在所选国家/地区是否有效，包括国家代码和位数。','Stricter check that the number is a valid mobile, fixed line, or other accepted type for the selected country. May reject some valid numbers.' => '更严格地验证该号码是否为所选国家/地区认可的有效手机号、固话号或其他类型号码。可能会拒绝部分有效号码。','Validation types' => '验证类型','Placeholders' => '占位符','No license keys to manage at the moment. License keys will appear here when a licensed Fluid Checkout plugin or add-on is active.' => '目前无需管理任何许可证密钥。当已授权的 Fluid Checkout 插件或扩展处于激活状态时，许可证密钥将显示在此处。','Default delivery type' => '默认配送方式','Choose which delivery type will be selected by default.' => '选择默认选中的配送类型。','Shipping zone fields' => '配送区域字段','Choose which fields will be displayed for the local pickup shipping zone filter fields. Leave empty to show all available options.' => '选择要显示在“本地自提”配送区域筛选字段中的字段。若留空，则显示所有可用选项。','These fields will be displayed as a filter for the local pickup shipping methods. Some fields might still appear at checkout when not selected here, if compatible plugins require them to work properly.' => '这些字段将作为“自提”配送方式的筛选条件显示。如果兼容的插件需要这些字段才能正常工作，那么即使在此处未选中，某些字段在结账时仍可能会显示。','Order shipping address' => '订单收货地址','Order pay page optimization' => '订单支付页面优化','Give unpaid orders the same clear, conversion-focused layout as checkout.' => '让未付款订单采用与结账页面同样清晰、以转化率为核心的布局。','Optimize the layout of the order pay page for orders pending payment.' => '优化待付款订单的付款页面布局。','Match the order pay experience to your checkout for a consistent purchase journey.' => '将“按订单支付”功能与您的结账流程相匹配，以打造一致的购买体验。','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance before paying.' => '在购物者付款前需要获得安心保障的地方，添加信任标识和认证徽章。','Thank you page optimization' => '感谢页面的优化','Make the thank you page and order details clearer for customers after they buy.' => '在顾客购买后，应让感谢页面和订单详情更加清晰易懂。','Optimize the thank you page and account order details with a clearer layout.' => '优化“感谢”页面和订单详情页，采用更清晰的布局。','Show order status progress, actions, downloads, and notes where they make sense.' => '在合适的位置显示订单状态进度、操作、下载内容和备注。','Customize order details sections on email notifications.' => '自定义电子邮件通知中的订单详情部分。','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance after purchase.' => '在购物者购买后需要获得安心保障的地方，添加信任标识和认证徽章。','Email notifications' => '电子邮件通知','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations to see more options' => '启用“感谢页面”和“订单详情”优化功能，以查看更多选项','Use wide layout on thank you page' => '在感谢页面上使用宽版布局','These options affect the thank you page, view order details on account pages and on email notifications.' => '这些选项会影响感谢页、账户页面上的订单详情以及电子邮件通知中的订单详情显示。','Save settings' => '保存设置','Docs' => '文档','Cart' => '购物车','Thank you' => '谢谢','Address autocomplete' => '地址自动补全','Trust badges' => '信任徽章','You do not have permission to save these settings.' => '您无权保存这些设置。','Invalid save request.' => '保存请求无效。','Your settings have been saved.' => '您的设置已保存。','Saving...' => '正在保存...','Settings could not be saved. Please try again.' => '无法保存设置。请重试。','Dismiss notice' => '关闭通知','Open settings menu' => '打开设置菜单','Close settings menu' => '关闭设置菜单','Preview' => '预览','Expand preview' => '展开预览','Collapse preview' => '折叠预览','Show header and footer' => '显示页眉和页脚','Hide header and footer' => '隐藏页眉和页脚','Page preview' => '页面预览','Preview viewport' => '预览视口','Tablet' => '平板电脑','Desktop' => '桌面','Preview width' => '预览宽度','Decrease width' => '缩小宽度','Preview width in pixels' => '预览宽度（单位：像素）','Increase width' => '增加宽度','Preview as' => '以...形式预览','Guest' => '访客','Logged in' => '已登录','Preview page' => '预览页面','Expand preview for a closer look' => '展开预览以查看详情','Available with %s.' => '可通过 %s 获取。','Turn them on' => '打开它们','Optimizations for this page are turned off. %s to preview the page.' => '此页面的优化功能已关闭。%s 可预览该页面。','%s preview' => '%s 预览','Isolated session · nothing is saved' => '隔离会话 · 没有任何内容被保存','Usage tracking' => '使用情况跟踪','Send non-sensitive site environment reports to help Fluid Checkout improve compatibility. Reports are not sent until enabled in the options below.' => '发送非敏感的站点环境报告，以帮助 Fluid Checkout 提升兼容性。除非在以下选项中启用该功能，否则不会发送报告。','Send usage tracking reports to Fluid Checkout' => '将使用情况跟踪报告发送至 Fluid Checkout','These reports help us improve compatibility and support for your site and are sent weekly when enabled.' => '这些报告有助于我们改进对您网站的兼容性和支持，启用后每周都会发送一次。','No customer, admin user, or any other sensitive data is included in the reports.' => '报告中不包含任何客户、管理员用户或其他敏感数据。','Basic environment info' => '基本环境信息','WordPress, PHP, WooCommerce, theme, and plugin list data. Always included when reporting is enabled. Helps us understand the environment your site is running in.' => 'WordPress、PHP、WooCommerce、主题和插件列表数据。在启用报告功能时，这些数据会始终被包含在内。这有助于我们了解您网站所运行的环境。','Plugin settings' => '插件设置','Sends Fluid Checkout plugin settings to help with support requests and helps us understand how you are using our plugins.' => '将 Fluid Checkout 插件的设置发送给我们，以便处理支持请求，并帮助我们了解您如何使用我们的插件。','Coming soon' => '即将推出','Sales metrics' => '销售指标','Monthly order count and total sales for one year prior to installing Fluid Checkout up to today. Helps us understand if you are making more money with our plugins installed. No customer or user data is ever sent.' => '从安装 Fluid Checkout 之前的一年到今天为止的每月订单数量和总销售额。这有助于我们了解安装我们的插件后您的收益是否有所增加。绝不会发送任何客户或用户数据。','Utilities' => '公用事业','Use <code>TomSelect</code> dropdown components instead of <code>select2</code>' => '请使用 <code>TomSelect</code> 下拉列表组件，而不是 <code>select2</code>','TomSelect is a simpler dropdown selection component which is less prone to errors than Select2, while offering the same functionality.' => 'TomSelect 是一个更简洁的下拉选择组件，它比 Select2 更不易出错，同时提供了相同的功能。','Sets the font size inside form fields to 16px on pages optimized by this plugin to avoid automatically zooming in when interacting with form fields on small devices.' => '将本插件优化过的页面中表单字段内的字体大小设置为 16px，以避免在小屏幕设备上操作表单字段时自动放大显示。','Safari and other browsers might automatically zoom in on mobile devices to make the text easier to read when the font size is smaller than 16px.' => '在移动设备上，当字体大小小于 16px 时，Safari 及其他浏览器可能会自动放大显示，以便于阅读文本。','Enable script processing tracking on the browser console.' => '在浏览器控制台中启用脚本处理跟踪功能。','Unminified assets' => '未压缩的资源','Google Maps scripts' => 'Google 地图脚本','Do not remove duplicate Google Maps scripts' => '请勿删除重复的 Google 地图脚本','When enabled, duplicate Google Maps scripts will NOT be removed which can cause errors and performance issues. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => '启用此选项后，重复的 Google 地图脚本将不会被删除，这可能会导致错误和性能问题。请仅在排查故障时使用此选项。','Widget areas' => '小工具区域','Last step on mobile' => '移动端上的最后一步','Display widgets only at last step on mobile' => '在移动端仅在最后一步显示小部件','Display checkout trust badge widgets only when viewing the last checkout step on mobile devices' => '仅在移动设备上查看最后一步结账时显示结账信任徽章小部件','Standard' => '标准','VAT number field' => '增值税号字段','Add a VAT number field to the billing form.' => '在账单表单中添加一个增值税号字段。','Field label' => '字段标签','Set the label of the VAT number field (ie. VAT number). On multi-language websites, it is better to leave this field empty and translate the original string.' => '设置增值税号字段的标签（例如：增值税号）。在多语言网站中，最好将该字段留空，并翻译原始字符串。','VAT Number' => '增值税号','EU-VAT' => '欧盟增值税','Enable the VAT number field to see more options' => '启用“增值税号”字段以查看更多选项','VAT validation' => '增值税验证','Validate VAT number field for EU-VAT during checkout' => '在结账时对欧盟增值税（EU-VAT）的增值税号字段进行验证','Checks if the VAT Number provided is a valid VAT number registered on the European VIES Database (VAT Information Exchange System).' => '检查所提供的增值税号是否是欧洲VIES数据库（增值税信息交换系统）中注册的有效增值税号。','Shop VAT number' => '商店增值税号','The shop\'s VAT number used for requesting EU-VAT validation, and printed on invoices. <br><strong>We strongly recommend adding your Shop VAT number</strong> as otherwise the VIES consultation results might not be valid for accounting purposes. <br>Ie.: <code>ATU99999999</code> or <code>EE999999999</code>.' => '该店铺用于申请欧盟增值税验证的增值税号，并印在发票上。<br><strong>我们强烈建议您添加店铺的增值税号</strong>，否则VIES查询结果可能无法作为会计凭证使用。 <br>例如：<code>ATU99999999</code> 或 <code>EE999999999</code>。','Reverse charge' => '反向征税','Apply reverse charge mechanism' => '适用反向征税机制','Set tax rate to zero and display "Reverse charge" on invoices when the customer\'s VAT number is valid. A different "Reverse charge" text might be required depending on the store\'s country.' => '当客户的增值税号有效时，将税率设为零，并在发票上显示“反向征税”。根据商店所在国家/地区不同，可能需要使用不同的“反向征税”文字。','Same country' => '同一个国家','Apply reverse charge mechanism for transactions in the shop country:' => '对在店铺所在国进行的交易适用反向征税机制：','Enables applying reverse charge mechanism for transactions between companies in the same country as the shop.' => '允许对与商店位于同一国家的公司之间的交易适用反向征税机制。','Reverse charge exceptions' => '反向征税的例外情况','Select additional countries to skip applying the reverse charge mechanism.' => '选择其他国家/地区，以豁免适用反向征税机制。','Taxes will be charged to orders from these countries even when a valid VAT number is provided.' => '即使提供了有效的增值税号，来自这些国家的订单仍需缴纳税费。','Reverse charge label on invoices' => '发票上的反向征税标签','Set the label of "reverse charge" on the checkout page and order details.' => '在结账页面和订单详情中设置“反向计费”标签。','Reverse charge text on invoices' => '发票上的“逆向征税”说明','Set the label of "reverse charge" text on invoices.' => '设置发票上“逆向征税”字样的标签。','Tax to be paid on reverse charge basis' => '应按逆向征税方式缴纳的税款','Company name' => '公司名称','Autocomplete company name from VAT number' => '根据增值税号自动补全公司名称','Fill in the billing company name based on the valid VAT number provided by the customer.' => '请根据客户提供的有效增值税号填写开票公司名称。','Company name editing' => '公司名称编辑','Allow editing of auto-filled company name' => '允许编辑自动填充的公司名称','When enabled, customers can change the company name associated with the provided VAT number.' => '启用此功能后，客户可以更改与所提供的增值税号关联的公司名称。','EU-VAT for digital goods' => '数字商品的欧盟增值税','From January 1st, 2015, modifications have been made to the EU VAT regulations concerning digital goods, impacting exclusively B2C transactions. The VAT on digital goods must be calculated based on the customer\'s location, and evidence of this needs to be collected (IP address and billing address).' => '自2015年1月1日起，欧盟针对数字商品的增值税法规进行了修订，该修订仅对B2C交易产生影响。数字商品的增值税必须根据客户所在地进行计算，且需收集相关证明（IP地址和账单地址）。','Tax classes for digital goods' => '数字商品的税务分类','Select some tax classes' => '选择一些税目','Location evidence' => '位置证据','Collect customer\'s location evidence' => '收集客户的定位证据','Saves the IP address and validate it against the customer\'s billing address. Customer\'s must confirm their billing address by checking a checkbox on the checkout page if the country from their billing address and IP do not match.' => '保存 IP 地址，并根据客户的账单地址对其进行验证。如果客户的账单地址所在国家/地区与 IP 地址所在国家/地区不一致，则客户必须在结账页面勾选复选框以确认其账单地址。','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Change it in Customer accounts settings</a>.' => '此选项在 Fluid Checkout 中进行管理。<a href="%s">请在“客户账户设置”</a>中进行修改。','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. Change it under Fluid Checkout > Customer accounts.' => '此选项在 Fluid Checkout 中进行管理。请在“Fluid Checkout > 客户账户”下进行修改。','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available in the <a href="%s">Fluid Checkout settings</a>.' => '此选项在 Fluid Checkout 中进行管理。启用 Fluid Checkout 后，收货地址将始终设置为“默认使用客户的收货地址”。 客户在结账时仍可提供不同的收货地址和账单地址。<br><br>在 <a href="%s">Fluid Checkout 设置</a> 中，提供了一项选项，可将默认账单地址设置为与收货地址相同。','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available at WooCommerce > Settings > Fluid Checkout.' => '此选项在 Fluid Checkout 中进行管理。 启用 Fluid Checkout 后，配送地址将始终设置为“默认使用客户配送地址”。客户在结账时仍可提供不同的配送地址和账单地址。<br><br>在“WooCommerce > 设置 > Fluid Checkout”中，提供了一个选项，可将默认账单地址设置为与配送地址相同。','These settings have been moved to WP Admin > Fluid Checkout > Settings.' => '这些设置已移至“WP 管理后台 > Fluid Checkout > 设置”。','This WooCommerce Settings tab is deprecated and will be removed in Fluid Checkout 6.0.' => '此 WooCommerce“设置”选项卡已弃用，并将在 Fluid Checkout 6.0 中被移除。','Go to settings page' => '转到设置页面','Hide this tab permanently' => '永久隐藏此标签页','Site report preview' => '现场报告预览','This is the data that would be included in the next site environment report based on your current settings.' => '根据您当前的设置，以下数据将包含在下一份站点环境报告中。','Loading report preview...' => '正在加载报告预览...','Could not load the site report preview. Try again.' => '无法加载网站报告预览。请重试。','Could not send the site report. Try again.' => '无法发送站点报告。请重试。','Site report sent successfully.' => '站点报告已成功发送。','Enable and send now' => '启用并立即发送','Close' => '关闭','A site report request is already in progress. Try again in a moment.' => '站点报告请求正在处理中。请稍后再试。simplified Chinese (Mainland)','Site environment reporting is disabled.' => '站点环境报告功能已禁用。','No site report data is available to send.' => '没有可发送的现场报告数据。','This site domain cannot send environment reports (local or development domains are excluded).' => '该网站域名无法发送环境报告（本地或开发域名除外）。','A site report was sent recently. Try again later.' => '最近已发送了一份现场报告。请稍后再试。','The site report could not be sent. Try again later.' => '无法发送现场报告。请稍后再试。','Site environment reporting is not available.' => '无法提供站点环境报告。','No site report data is available for the selected settings.' => '对于所选设置，没有可用站点报告数据。','You are not allowed to manage site reports.' => '您无权管理网站报告。','PRO feature' => 'PRO 功能','Other plugins' => '其他插件','Get only this add-on &mdash; %s' => '仅获取此扩展程序 — %s','Install add-on' => '安装附加组件','Upgrade to PRO &mdash; %s' => '升级至 PRO —— %s','<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Get %2$s</a> to unlock these options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">获取 %2$s</a> 以解锁这些选项。','Add-on' => '附加组件','View documentation' => '查看文档','Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the current user\'s data, or pass user_id to target another account when the caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found.' => '请求需要已登录的 WordPress 用户。若要使用当前用户的数据，请省略 user_id；若调用者具有编辑该用户的权限（edit_user 权限），则可传入 user_id 以针对其他账户。未经身份验证的请求将返回 fc_api_forbidden。 如果 user_id 无效，将返回 fc_api_user_not_found。','HTTP 200 with { "data": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload.' => '当处理程序返回有效载荷时，返回 HTTP 200 状态码，响应体为 { "data": { ... } }。','HTTP 200 with { "success": true } when there is no payload (for example DELETE).' => '当没有有效载荷时（例如 DELETE 请求），返回 HTTP 200 状态码，并包含 { "success": true }。','Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix.' => '失败情况会返回来自 WP_Error 的 WordPress REST 错误 JSON（code、message、data.status）。Wire 代码使用 fc_api_* 前缀。','Forbidden access.' => '禁止进入。','Target user was not found.' => '未找到目标用户。','This feature is not available.' => '此功能不可用。','A required address field is missing.' => '缺少一个必填的地址字段。','Postcode or ZIP is invalid.' => '邮政编码或ZIP码无效。','Phone number is invalid.' => '该电话号码无效。','State or county is invalid.' => '该州或县无效。','Country is invalid or has no address fields.' => '国家/地区无效或没有地址字段。','The request could not be processed.' => '无法处理该请求。','Back to previous step' => '返回上一步','Skip to settings' => '跳转到设置','Start over and return to the first guided setup step' => '重新开始，返回第一个引导式设置步骤','Start over' => '重新开始','Please complete all sub-steps before continuing.' => '请先完成所有子步骤，然后再继续。','Expand' => '展开','Collapse' => '折叠','Skip' => '跳过','Mark as complete' => '标记为已完成','Mark as incomplete' => '标记为未完成','View full-size image: %s' => '查看全尺寸图片：%s','Full-size setup guide image' => '全尺寸设置指南图片','Close image' => '关闭图片','Fluid Checkout Guided Setup' => '流体结账引导式设置','Welcome' => '欢迎','Explore your checkout' => '查看您的订单','All set' => '一切就绪','You do not have permission to access this page.' => '您无权访问此页面。','Go to step %1$d: %2$s' => '转到步骤 %1$d：%2$s','This guided setup helps you get familiar with Fluid Checkout. The steps below are placeholders for now.' => '本分步设置指南可帮助您熟悉 Fluid Checkout。以下步骤目前仅为占位内容。','Continue to the next step when you are ready.' => '准备好了后，请继续进行下一步。','Open your store checkout to see Fluid Checkout in action.' => '打开您的店铺结账页面，亲身体验 Fluid Checkout 的实际效果。','View checkout page' => '查看结账页面','You can return to Fluid Checkout settings to continue configuring your store.' => '您可以返回 Fluid Checkout 设置页面，继续配置您的网店。','Review checkout and cart settings' => '查看结账和购物车设置','Explore add-ons from the dashboard' => '在仪表盘中浏览扩展程序','Finish & go to settings' => '完成并进入设置','Update the billing phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => '将“账单电话”字段的可见性选项从旧版设置更新为符合 WooCommerce 规范的设置。','Update the shipping phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => '将“配送电话”字段的可见性选项从旧版设置更新为符合 WooCommerce 规范的设置。','Copy the order summary background color setting to the new Split design secondary column background color option.' => '将“订单摘要”的背景色设置复制到“拆分设计”中“次要列”的背景色选项中。','The enhanced select fields feature is always disabled when using the Biteship plugin.' => '使用 Biteship 插件时，增强型选择字段功能始终处于禁用状态。','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => '在使用“德国市场”时，下单位置始终设置为“订单摘要下方”。该插件要求将“下单”按钮和法律条款复选框显示在订单摘要下方。','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => '使用 Germanized for WooCommerce 时，“提交订单”按钮的位置始终设置为“订单摘要下方”。该插件要求“提交订单”按钮和法律条款复选框显示在订单摘要下方。','Edit pickup locations' => '编辑取货地点','Use local pickup label from WooCommerce settings' => '在 WooCommerce 设置中使用本地自提标签','When enabled, the pickup option label on checkout matches the title from WooCommerce pickup location settings. When disabled, the label uses the translatable "Local pickup" text from Fluid Checkout.' => '启用此选项后，结账页面上的自提选项标签将与 WooCommerce 自提地点设置中的标题一致。禁用此选项后，标签将使用 Fluid Checkout 中可翻译的“本地自提”文本。','Button label for applying coupon codesApply' => '申请','Checkout step titleContact' => '联系方式','Checkout step titleShipping' => '运输','Checkout step titleBilling' => '账单','Checkout step titlePayment' => '付款方式','Checkout substep change link labelChange' => '改变','Checkout substep save link labelSave changes' => '保存更改','Substep review textNone.' => '无。','Substep revi